# `mf` Metadata Write Path

```mermaid
flowchart LR
    U[User] --> MF[mf]
    MF --> P[Permission Check]
    P --> V[Validate Fields]
    V --> S[Select Sense 1..3]
    S --> A[Atomic Metadata Transaction]
    A --> DB[Metadata Backend]
    DB --> F[File Payload Unchanged]
    A --> R[Result / Audit]
```

`mf` is the metadata counterpart to `lf`: `lf` observes; `mf` requests controlled metadata changes.
